# 1. feDisplacementMap: demultiply the displacement image and apply scale once; otherwise displacement escapes the filter region (upstream issue linebender/resvg#1019).
# 2. feConvolveMatrix: multiply bias by bounded output alpha, as required by Filter Effects 1.
# 3. feColorMatrix: round normalized channels to the nearest byte (CSS Color 4 section 5.1) instead of truncating.
# 4. Patterns: use nearest sampling for device-aligned 1:1 tiles so their edges do not blur or acquire seams.
# 5. feDropShadow: convert shadow colors only for linearRGB; an extra sRGB conversion incorrectly lightens the shadow.
# 6. Keep rendering compatible with the paired usvg parser/tree changes; apply usvg first (docs/VENDORING.md).
